    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474830/extras/66bc50014ca31edf1e8436ba8a2e2241.avif?t=1752718016\" /></span>A boy named &quot;Cain&quot; has lost his memories. Join him and the musket-wielding succubus maid &quot;Grenadier&quot; as you shoot your way through hordes of diverse monster girls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can he safely recover his memories and return to his happy days? That's entirely up to the choices you, the player, make!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474830/extras/2c54ad5dbad050d22bb116aa2671f5be.avif?t=1752718016\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bullet-hell action STG</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stage selection system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monster girls </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire abilities from defeated bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Selectable difficulty levels</p></li></ul>",
